{"lang":"tl","dir":"ltr","title":"C&#39;s Cuts | Barbershop sa Fairfield, CA: fade, taper at line-up","body":"<a class=\"skip\" href=\"#main\">Lumaktaw sa nilalaman</a>\n<header class=\"topbar\">\n  <div class=\"wrap topbar-in\">\n    <a class=\"brand\" href=\"#top\"><span class=\"brand-mark\" aria-hidden=\"true\">C&#39;s</span><span>C&#39;s Cuts</span></a>\n    <nav class=\"nav\"><a href=\"#about\">Tungkol sa amin</a><a href=\"#services\">Serbisyo</a><a href=\"#faq\">FAQ</a><a href=\"#gallery\">Mga larawan</a><a href=\"#reviews\">Mga review</a><a href=\"#visit\">Oras at lokasyon</a></nav>\n    <label class=\"lang-pick\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2a10 10 0 1 0 0 20 10 10 0 0 0 0-20zm6.9 6h-2.9a15.7 15.7 0 0 0-1.4-3.6A8 8 0 0 1 18.9 8zM12 4c.8 1.2 1.5 2.5 1.9 4h-3.8c.4-1.5 1.1-2.8 1.9-4zM4.3 14a8.2 8.2 0 0 1 0-4h3.4a16.5 16.5 0 0 0 0 4H4.3zm.8 2h2.9c.3 1.3.8 2.5 1.4 3.6A8 8 0 0 1 5.1 16zM8 8H5.1a8 8 0 0 1 4.3-3.6C8.8 5.5 8.3 6.7 8 8zm4 12c-.8-1.2-1.5-2.5-1.9-4h3.8c-.4 1.5-1.1 2.8-1.9 4zm2.3-6H9.7a14.7 14.7 0 0 1 0-4h4.6a14.7 14.7 0 0 1 0 4zm.3 5.6c.6-1.1 1.1-2.3 1.4-3.6h2.9a8 8 0 0 1-4.3 3.6zM16.3 14a16.5 16.5 0 0 0 0-4h3.4a8.2 8.2 0 0 1 0 4h-3.4z\"/></svg><select id=\"langSel\" aria-label=\"Wika\"><option value=\"en\" lang=\"en\">English</option><option value=\"es\" lang=\"es\">Español</option><option value=\"tl\" lang=\"tl\" selected>Tagalog</option><option value=\"vi\" lang=\"vi\">Tiếng Việt</option><option value=\"zh\" lang=\"zh\">中文</option><option value=\"pa\" lang=\"pa\">ਪੰਜਾਬੀ</option><option value=\"hi\" lang=\"hi\">हिन्दी</option><option value=\"ko\" lang=\"ko\">한국어</option><option value=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">العربية</option></select></label>\n    <a class=\"btn btn-sm btn-primary\" href=\"tel:+17076737601\">Tumawag</a>\n  </div>\n</header>\n\n<main id=\"main\">\n<section class=\"hero\" id=\"top\">\n  <div class=\"hero-bg\" style=\"background-image:url('images/storefront.jpg')\"></div>\n  <div class=\"wrap hero-in\">\n    <p class=\"eyebrow\">Barbershop · Fairfield, CA · Mula 2010</p>\n    <h1>C&#39;s Cuts</h1>\n    <p class=\"tagline\">Malinis na fade, matalas na line-up, at mga barberong hindi nagmamadali. Ang barbershop ng komunidad sa Fairfield mula 2010.</p>\n    <div class=\"hero-meta\"><a class=\"rating-badge\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/C%27s+Cuts/@38.2697674,-122.0337414,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x8085167f609079b9:0x6d44cf17cd1bec5c!8m2!3d38.2697674!4d-122.0337414!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span class=\"stars\">★★★★★</span>4.8 · 135 review sa Google<span class=\"ext\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↗</span></a><span class=\"open-badge\" id=\"openBadge\" hidden></span></div>\n    <div class=\"cta-row\">\n      <a class=\"btn btn-primary btn-lg\" href=\"tel:+17076737601\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6.6 10.8a15.1 15.1 0 0 0 6.6 6.6l2.2-2.2c.3-.3.7-.4 1-.2 1.1.4 2.3.6 3.6.6.6 0 1 .4 1 1V20c0 .6-.4 1-1 1A17 17 0 0 1 3 4c0-.6.4-1 1-1h3.5c.6 0 1 .4 1 1 0 1.3.2 2.5.6 3.6.1.3 0 .7-.2 1l-2.3 2.2z\"/></svg> Tumawag para makapasok</a>\n      <a class=\"btn btn-ghost btn-lg\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&amp;destination=C&#39;s%20Cuts%2C%202240%20N%20Texas%20St%2C%20Fairfield%2C%20CA%2094533\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2a7 7 0 0 0-7 7c0 5.2 7 13 7 13s7-7.8 7-13a7 7 0 0 0-7-7zm0 9.5A2.5 2.5 0 1 1 12 6.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 0 5z\"/></svg> Direksyon</a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"stripe\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"highlights\"><div class=\"wrap\"><ul><li>Mula 2010</li><li>Welcome ang walk-in</li><li>Cash o Zelle</li><li>Gupit pambata</li><li>Pribadong parking lot</li><li>Accessible sa wheelchair</li></ul></div></div>\n\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"about\"><div class=\"wrap about-grid\"><div><p class=\"kicker\">Ang shop</p><h2>Walang madalian. Magandang gupit lang.</h2><p>Ang C&#39;s Cuts (kilala rin bilang C&#39;s Barber Shop) ay nanggugupit sa North Texas Street mula pa noong 2010. Espesyalidad namin ang fresh cut, taper, fade, crew cut, trim at razor line-up.</p><p>Si Chris, si Christine at ang buong team ay hindi nagmamadali, maingat sa detalye, at madaling kausap. Marami ring magulang ang nagdadala ng kanilang mga anak.</p><div class=\"facts\"><a class=\"fact\" href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/C%27s+Cuts/@38.2697674,-122.0337414,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x8085167f609079b9:0x6d44cf17cd1bec5c!8m2!3d38.2697674!4d-122.0337414!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><b>4.8★</b><span>135 review</span></a><div class=\"fact\"><b>Walk-in</b><span>Welcome</span></div><div class=\"fact\"><b>2010</b><span>Itinatag</span></div></div></div><div class=\"about-img\"><img src=\"images/fade-cut.jpg\" alt=\"Bagong fade sa C&#39;s Cuts\" loading=\"lazy\"></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"services\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">Sa upuan</p><h2>Gupit at serbisyo</h2><p>Ang aming mga espesyalidad. Sabihin lang sa barbero mo kung may gusto kang kakaiba.</p></div><div class=\"services\"><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">01</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>Fresh cut</h3></div><p>Ang karaniwan mong gupit, nilinis at hinubog ayon sa gusto mo.</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">02</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>Fade</h3></div><p>Low, mid, high at bald fade na malinis ang pagkaka-blend.</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">03</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>Taper</h3></div><p>Malinis na taper sa batok at sentido.</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">04</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>Crew cut</h3></div><p>Maikli, klasiko at madaling alagaan.</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">05</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>Trim</h3></div><p>Panatilihin ang haba at ayusin ang lahat.</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">06</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>Razor line-up</h3></div><p>Matalas na gilid na tinapos gamit ang straight razor.</p></article><article class=\"service\"><span class=\"service-num\">07</span><div class=\"service-top\"><h3>Gupit pambata</h3></div><p>Matiyagang barbero para sa mga bata (at sa mga mapiling magulang).</p></article></div><p class=\"note\">Hindi naka-post online ang presyo. Tumawag sa (707) 673-7601 para sa kasalukuyang presyo. Bayad: cash o Zelle lang.</p></div></section>\n\n\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"amenities\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">Mabuting malaman</p><h2>Bago ka pumunta</h2></div><ul class=\"amenities\"><li><b>Welcome ang walk-in</b></li><li><b>Cash o Zelle</b><span>Walang credit card</span></li><li><b>Pribadong parking lot</b><span>Hiwalay sa kalye, may ilaw, may pasukan sa harap at likod</span></li><li><b>Paradahan ng bisikleta</b></li><li><b>Accessible sa wheelchair</b></li><li><b>Gupit pambata</b><span>Maraming magulang ang nagdadala ng kanilang mga anak</span></li><li><b>Itinatag noong 2010</b></li></ul></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section\" id=\"gallery\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">Gallery</p><h2>Mula sa shop</h2></div><div class=\"gallery\"><figure><img src=\"images/fade-cut.jpg\" alt=\"Skin fade na may matalas na line-up\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/textured-cut.jpg\" alt=\"Fade na mas mahaba at may texture sa itaas\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/storefront.jpg\" alt=\"Harapan ng C&#39;s Cuts sa 2240 N Texas St\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure><figure><img src=\"images/storefront-2.jpg\" alt=\"Pasukan ng C&#39;s Cuts na may barber pole\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></div></div></section>\n\n\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"reviews\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">Mga review</p><h2>Ang paboritong upuan sa Fairfield</h2></div><div class=\"ratings\"><div class=\"rating-card\"><span class=\"rating-big\">4.8</span><div><div class=\"stars\">★★★★★</div><div><b>Google</b> · 135 review</div><a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/place/C%27s+Cuts/@38.2697674,-122.0337414,17z/data=!4m8!3m7!1s0x8085167f609079b9:0x6d44cf17cd1bec5c!8m2!3d38.2697674!4d-122.0337414!9m1!1b1\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Magbasa pa ng mga review sa Google →</a></div></div><div class=\"rating-card\"><span class=\"rating-big\">4.5</span><div><div class=\"stars\">★★★★★</div><div><b>Yelp</b> · 34 review</div><a href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/cs-barber-shop-fairfield#reviews\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Magbasa pa ng mga review sa Yelp →</a></div></div></div><div class=\"reviews\"><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“Woke up this morning took a quick glance in the mirror; and thought to myself &quot;Dam C!!!! you did a great job on the haircut....Thnx Bro!!&quot; Cya on the nxt1”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=C%27s%20Cuts%202240%20N%20Texas%20St%20Fairfield%20CA%2094533\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Oct 2025</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“Best haircut I’ve had in my two years in Cali and I’ll definitely be here every month. I recommend this shop to anyone who wants a legit cut for a legit price (don’t forget to tip). They make sure you’re not looking in the mirror afterwards wondering why you still go to them.”</blockquote><figcaption>— T&#39;Arris B. · <a href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/cs-barber-shop-fairfield\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Yelp</a></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“Found my new go to barber in Fairfield. Chris and Christine are cool people, and all the barbers know what they’re doing. My first time I got a fresh fade from Christine. They take their time to give you the best cut for your money. Definitely recommend checking them out. Support your local Filipino shop!”</blockquote><figcaption>— Thomas A. · <a href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/cs-barber-shop-fairfield\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Yelp</a></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“Just got a cut from Chris and it was honestly one of the best I’ve had. He took his time, paid attention to every detail, and the fade came out super clean. The top was shaped perfectly, and you can tell he genuinely cares about his clients. He’s down to earth, easy to talk to, and really takes pride in what he does. If you’re looking for someone who doesn’t rush and delivers high-quality work, Chris is the one.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=C%27s%20Cuts%202240%20N%20Texas%20St%20Fairfield%20CA%2094533\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · May 2025</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“C’s Barbershop is great. I get my haircut by Chris. He’s a stand up guy — a great barber and friend. Always offers good conversation and takes pride in his craft. I always leave the shop feeling good about myself. My friend also gets his haircut by Chris’ wife, and she is talented as well. Affordable prices and great company has me coming back as a regular!”</blockquote><figcaption>— James R. · <a href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/cs-barber-shop-fairfield\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Yelp</a></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“C&#39;s cuts has been my go-to place for almost 15 years for my hair cut needs. The environment is always great, and well-rounded barbers with steady hands are always hard to find, especially ones for such a great price. I truly recommend everybody to get their cuts, line ups, and fades at C&#39;s. You won&#39;t regret how great you look and feel afterward”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=C%27s%20Cuts%202240%20N%20Texas%20St%20Fairfield%20CA%2094533\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Oct 2024</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“Chris and Christine takes their time to cut my hair. They are both very skilled barbers. Highly recommended if you want a nice clean and sharp looking haircut. Hint: go to either Chris and Christine first for your first time haircut.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Alexander C. · <a href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/cs-barber-shop-fairfield\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Yelp</a></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“I’ve been coming to this place for a couple years now, and they’ve always been really kind and understanding. Before finding this place I had a really rough time finding someone who could cut my hair the way I like it, and by my surprise I found it down the street from me. 100/100 I’d recommend this place, and if you’re into a more chilled out vibe this is the place.”</blockquote><figcaption>— Google reviewer · <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/?api=1&amp;query=C%27s%20Cuts%202240%20N%20Texas%20St%20Fairfield%20CA%2094533\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Google</a> · Aug 2025</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"review\"><div class=\"stars\" aria-label=\"5 out of 5\">★★★★★</div><blockquote>“I have two young boys and I can be very picky on who cuts their hair. I tend to have the usual people cut their hair but unfortunately none of them were available. I decided to go where my nephew always goes, C’s Barbershop. Let me just say that I’m very impressed !! Shoutout to the talented female who cut their hair! I wish I knew her name! I will definitely be bringing them back to her :)”</blockquote><figcaption>— Jeanette A. · <a href=\"https://www.yelp.com/biz/cs-barber-shop-fairfield\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Yelp</a></figcaption></figure></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section alt\" id=\"faq\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"section-head\"><p class=\"kicker\">FAQ</p><h2>Mga tanong, sinagot</h2></div><div class=\"faq\"><details><summary>Kailangan ko ba ng appointment?</summary><p>Hindi, pumasok ka lang. Kung mas gusto mo ng appointment o gusto mong malaman kung gaano katagal ang hintay, tawagan kami sa (707) 673-7601.</p></details><details><summary>Tumatanggap ba kayo ng credit card?</summary><p>Hindi kami tumatanggap ng credit card. Cash o Zelle ang tinatanggap namin.</p></details><details><summary>Anong oras kayo bukas?</summary><p>Bukas kami Lunes hanggang Sabado, 10 AM hanggang 5 PM, at sarado tuwing Linggo. Maaaring magbago ang oras, kaya tumawag muna.</p></details><details><summary>Saan ako puwedeng pumarada?</summary><p>May pribado kaming parking lot at dalawang pasukan, isa sa harap at isa sa likod.</p></details><details><summary>Gumugupit ba kayo ng buhok ng bata?</summary><p>Oo! Maraming magulang ang nagdadala ng kanilang mga anak na lalaki.</p></details><details><summary>Gaano na katagal bukas ang shop?</summary><p>Bukas na kami mula pa noong 2010.</p></details><details><summary>Accessible ba sa wheelchair ang shop?</summary><p>Oo, accessible kami sa wheelchair.</p></details></div></div></section>\n\n<section class=\"section visit\" id=\"visit\">\n  <div class=\"wrap visit-grid\">\n    <div class=\"visit-info\">\n      <p class=\"kicker\">Bisitahin kami</p>\n      <h2>Oras at lokasyon</h2>\n      <address>2240 N Texas St<br>Fairfield, CA